#, php-format
msgid "%1$s / %2$s (%3$.1f%%, n=%4$d)"
msgstr "%1$s / %2$s (%3$.1f%%, n=%4$d)"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:505
msgid "(通常403の対照群です。意味的抑止の本文は返しません。)"
msgstr ""
"(Control arm: standard 403. No semantic deterrence message body is returned.)"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:906
msgid "1 / 3"
msgstr "1 / 3"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:59
msgid "1. 方針通知"
msgstr "1. Policy notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:673
msgid ""
"1行に1つのパス前方一致を指定します。一致したものは other_high_confidence とし"
"て扱います。正当なサイト固有エンドポイントは除外パスへ入れてください。"
msgstr ""
"Enter one path prefix per line. Matches are treated as "
"other_high_confidence. Add legitimate site-specific endpoints to Excluded "
"Paths."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:666
msgid ""
"1行に1つのパス前方一致を指定します。一致したリクエストは記録もレスポンス変更"
"もしません。"
msgstr ""
"Enter one path prefix per line. Matching requests are neither logged nor "
"modified."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:680
msgid ""
"1行に1つの完全一致IPを指定します。IPはローカル除外とHMAC生成にだけ使います。"
msgstr ""
"Enter one exact-match IP address per line. IP addresses are used only for "
"local exclusions and HMAC generation."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:916
msgid "2 / 3"
msgstr "2 / 3"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:60
msgid "2. 検知とローカル記録の通知"
msgstr "2. Detection and local logging notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:277
msgid "24時間の推移"
msgstr "24-hour trend"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:926
msgid "3 / 3"
msgstr "3 / 3"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:61
msgid "3. 継続しても得るものが少ない通知"
msgstr "3. Notice that continuing offers little value"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:319
msgid "30日"
msgstr "30 days"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:62
msgid "4. 機械可読通知"
msgstr "4. Machine-readable notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:63
msgid "5. 統合通知"
msgstr "5. Combined notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-plugin.php:79
msgid "5分ごと"
msgstr "Every 5 minutes"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:318
msgid "7日"
msgstr "7 days"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:320
msgid "90日"
msgstr "90 days"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:688
msgid "Cloudflareの国・地域コードを使う"
msgstr "Use Cloudflare country/region codes"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:690
msgid ""
"Cloudflare経由であることを確認したサイトだけで有効にしてください。CF-"
"IPCountryの2文字コードだけをローカル保存し、IPは保存しません。この情報はHubへ"
"送信しません。"
msgstr ""
"Enable only on sites confirmed to be behind Cloudflare. Only the two-letter "
"CF-IPCountry code is stored locally; IP addresses are not stored. This "
"information is not sent to the Hub."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:337
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1102
msgid "HTTP"
msgstr "HTTP"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:701
msgid "Hub URL"
msgstr "Hub URL"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-plugin.php:176
msgid "Hub URL、Key ID、共有秘密鍵が必要です。"
msgstr "Hub URL, Key ID, and shared secret are required."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:697
msgid "Hub接続"
msgstr "Hub Connection"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:708
msgid "Key ID"
msgstr "Key ID"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:30
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:31
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:103
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:208
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:546
msgid "Semantic Deterrence"
msgstr "Semantic Deterrence"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1006
msgid "Semantic Deterrence の画面"
msgstr "Semantic Deterrence screen"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1046
msgid "Torネットワーク"
msgstr "Tor network"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:113
msgid "v0.1系 試験運用"
msgstr "v0.1 pilot"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:137
msgid ""
"「攻撃を止めた」「AIを検出した」とは断定しません。「警告後に探索継続を観測し"
"なかった」と表現します。"
msgstr ""
"We do not claim that \"an attack was stopped\" or \"AI was detected.\" We "
"say, \"no continuation was observed after the warning.\""

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:251
msgid ""
"このWordPressサイト内で観測したローカル集計です。共有Hubの集計や他サイトの結"
"果は含みません。"
msgstr ""
"These are local aggregates observed on this WordPress site. They do not "
"include shared Hub aggregates or results from other sites."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:267
msgid "このサイトだけの参考観測"
msgstr "Observations on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:356
msgid ""
"このサイトで返した応答ごとの推定効果です。共有Hubの集計とは分けて表示します。"
msgstr ""
"Estimated effect of each response returned by this site. Shown separately "
"from shared Hub aggregates."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:643
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:935
msgid "このサイトの匿名集計を日次で提供する"
msgstr "Provide this site's anonymous aggregates daily"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:355
msgid "このサイトの応答別比較"
msgstr "Comparison by response on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:327
msgid "このサイトの直近観測"
msgstr "Recent observations on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:218
msgid "このサイトの観測"
msgstr "Observations on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1278
msgid "このサイトの観測のみ"
msgstr "Observe this site only"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:302
msgid "このサイトの観測期間別"
msgstr "Observations by period on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:250
msgid "このサイトの過去30日"
msgstr "Past 30 days on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1311
msgid "このサイトを一時制限中"
msgstr "Temporarily limiting this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1279
msgid "このサイトを抑止"
msgstr "Deter on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1280
msgid "このサイトを抑止 + 一時制限"
msgstr "Deter on this site + temporary limit"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:598
msgid ""
"このサイトを抑止しながら、固定カタログと対照群を使ったローカル応答実験を有効"
"にする"
msgstr ""
"Enable a local response experiment using the fixed catalog and control arm "
"while deterring suspicious probing on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:931
msgid "このサイトを抑止しながらローカル応答実験に参加する"
msgstr ""
"Participate in the local response experiment while deterring suspicious "
"probing on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:901
msgid "このサイトを抑止しながら実験に参加し、匿名集計データを提供しますか？"
msgstr ""
"Participate in the experiment while deterring suspicious probing on this "
"site and contribute anonymous aggregate data?"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1281
msgid "このサイトを抑止しながら実験参加"
msgstr "Participate in the experiment while deterring on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:601
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1312
msgid "このサイトを抑止しながら実験参加中"
msgstr "Participating in the experiment while deterring on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1310
msgid "このサイトを抑止中"
msgstr "Deterring on this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1309
msgid "このサイトを観測中"
msgstr "Observing this site"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:110
msgid "このプラグインで検証したいこと"
msgstr "What this plugin tests"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:900
msgid ""
"このプラグインは、不審な自動探索へ意味的な応答を返した後に、探索継続を観測し"
"たかを測定します。"
msgstr ""
"This plugin measures whether probing continued after a semantic response was "
"returned to suspicious automated probing."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:220
msgid ""
"このプラグインは訪問者をAIと判定しません。不審な探索にこのサイトの応答を返し"
"た後、探索が継続したかを測定します。"
msgstr ""
"This plugin does not classify visitors as AI. It measures whether probing "
"continued after this site returned a response to suspicious probing."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:99
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:187
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:540
msgid "このプラグインを管理する権限がありません。"
msgstr "You are not authorized to manage this plugin."

#. translators: %s: local datetime.
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:622
#, php-format
msgid ""
"この割り当ては %s にロックされました。途中変更で比較が濁らないよう、このサイ"
"トでは変更できません。"
msgstr ""
"This assignment was locked on %s. It cannot be changed on this site, so mid-"
"experiment changes do not compromise the comparison."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:761
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:800
msgid "この設定を保存する権限がありません。"
msgstr "You are not authorized to save these settings."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:121
msgid ""
"これはWAF、CDNルール、レート制限、アクセス制御の代替ではありません。エージェ"
"ントの行動判断へ追加の摩擦を与える「意味的抑止」レイヤーです。"
msgstr ""
"This is not a replacement for a WAF, CDN rules, rate limiting, or access "
"controls. It is a semantic deterrence layer that adds friction to an agent's "
"decision-making."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:149
msgid ""
"まず「観測のみ」で通常運用し、誤検知や管理画面・REST API・Ajaxへの影響がない"
"か確認します。"
msgstr ""
"Start with Observation Only under normal traffic and check for false "
"positives or effects on the admin area, REST API, or Ajax."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:458
msgid "まだ閾値未満"
msgstr "Below threshold"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:648
msgid "アンインストール"
msgstr "Uninstall"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:650
msgid "アンインストール時にローカル集計データと設定を削除する"
msgstr "Delete local aggregate data and settings when uninstalling"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:403
msgid "エージェントへ返す内容"
msgstr "Content returned to the agent"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:592
msgid ""
"クライアント間で比較できるよう、固定カタログ1〜5から選びます。自由文はv0.1の"
"比較対象にしません。"
msgstr ""
"Select from fixed catalog entries 1-5 to support comparisons across clients. "
"Free-form text is excluded from v0.1 comparisons."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:468
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:485
msgid "サイト数"
msgstr "Site count"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:51
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:997
