msgstr "Dashboard"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:150
msgid "ダッシュボードで検知カテゴリ、件数、直近観測、継続の有無を確認します。"
msgstr ""
"Use the Dashboard to review detection categories, counts, recent "
"observations, and whether probing continued."

