msgstr "Delete Local Aggregate Data"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:983
msgid ""
"ローカル集計データを削除し、観測のみへ戻しました。実験割り当ては再度選択でき"
"ます。"
msgstr ""
"Local aggregate data was deleted and the mode was reset to Observation Only. "
"You can select the experiment assignment again."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1143
msgid "一時制限"
msgstr "Temporary Limit"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:633
msgid "一時制限秒数"
msgstr "Temporary limit duration in seconds"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:254
msgid "不審な探索を検知"
msgstr "Suspicious probing detected"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:111
msgid ""
"不審な自動探索に対して、通常のHTTP拒否だけでなく、機械可読な状態と自然言語の"
"撤退勧告を返したとき、その後の探索継続が減るかを観測します。"
msgstr ""
"We observe whether subsequent probing decreases when suspicious automated "
"probing receives a machine-readable status and a natural-language "
"recommendation to disengage in addition to a standard HTTP denial."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:312
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:366
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:383
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:472
