msgstr "Unknown country or region"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:176
msgid "中央からは命令しない"
msgstr "No central commands"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:317
msgid "今日"
msgstr "Today"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:328
msgid ""
"他のセキュリティ通知と時刻や分類を見比べるためのローカル観測です。このプラグ"
"インはWAFログを読みません。IP、URL、User-Agent、Cookie、リクエスト本文は保存"
"していません。"
msgstr ""
"These local observations let you compare timestamps and classifications with "
"other security alerts. This plugin does not read WAF logs or store IP "
"addresses, URLs, User-Agent strings, cookies, or request bodies."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:363
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:380
